flowchart TD
    A([Start crawl]) --> B[Normalize seed URLs]
    B --> C{Each seed in scope?}
    C -- No --> D[Raise ValueError]
    C -- Yes --> E[Deduplicate seeds]
    E --> F[Initialize FIFO frontier at depth 0<br/>and tracking sets and result lists]
    F --> G{Frontier non-empty<br/>and attempts below max_pages?}
    G -- No --> Z[Build CrawlResult metadata]
    G -- Yes --> H{Elapsed-time limit reached?}
    H -- Yes --> Z
    H -- No --> I[Pop next URL and depth<br/>mark attempted and visited]
    I --> J[Retrieve page]
    J --> K{Retrieval raised<br/>or result is invalid?}
    K -- Yes --> L[Record retrieve failure]
    L --> G
    K -- No --> M{Final URL provided?}
    M -- No --> Q[Mark requested URL successful]
    M -- Yes --> N[Normalize final URL]
    N --> O{Final URL valid<br/>and in scope?}
    O -- No --> P[Record redirect failure]
    P --> G
    O -- Yes --> Q
    Q --> R{Elapsed-time limit reached?}
    R -- Yes --> G
    R -- No --> S[Discover links from page content]
    S --> T{Link discovery raises,<br/>returns a string, or yields<br/>a non-string link?}
    T -- Yes --> U[Record discover failure<br/>keep page successful]
    U --> G
    T -- No --> V{More candidate links<br/>and time remains?}
    V -- No --> G
    V -- Yes --> W[Normalize candidate against<br/>final URL]
    W --> X{Valid URL and in scope?}
    X -- No --> V
    X -- Yes --> Y[Record unique edge from<br/>final URL to target]
    Y --> AA{Target is not a seed<br/>and not already discovered?}
    AA -- Yes --> AB[Record discovered target]
    AA -- No --> AC{Depth below max_depth<br/>and target is neither<br/>scheduled nor attempted?}
    AB --> AC
    AC -- Yes --> AD[Schedule target at depth + 1]
    AC -- No --> V
    AD --> V
    Z --> AE([Return CrawlResult])
